From: H713 HDMI capture workstream
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: h713: add a bench EDID clock/reset consumer

The bounded SCP HPD/EDID trial requires h713-edid-clock.ko to bind a
platform device. The first dedicated-trace FIT omitted that test node, so
the module loaded but did not hold the EDID clock or release its reset. Add
the board-local consumer only to the HDMI diagnostic kernel branch. The
module still must be loaded deliberately; the node alone does not touch
the peripheral.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts
@@ -20,1 +20,7 @@
+
+	h713-edid-clock-hold {
+		compatible = "h713-lab,edid-clock-hold";
+		clocks = <&r_ccu CLK_R_EDID>;
+		resets = <&r_ccu RST_R_EDID>;
+	};
 };
